<section>
  <div class="wrap {{ 'two two--top' if pics.length else 'narrow' }}">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Upper Secondary</p>
      <h2>The dinner party debate</h2>
      <p>Each Upper Secondary student chose a question and imagined a dinner party where famous people from history and today argue it out. Their posters show the table, the guests and what each one says: Napoleon and Abraham Lincoln on taxes and revolution, Einstein on artificial intelligence, Dolly Parton on whether people are born to work together.</p>
      <p>Other tables took on an age limit for social media and whether parents should genetically enhance their children. At the showcase the students guided their parents through their debates, and one talked his grandfather through his.</p>
    </div>
