      <h2>How a plant grows</h2>
      <p>Ms. Solo began with a short introduction for the parents. Then Year 1 acted out how a plant grows, playing the sun, the rain, the plants and the gardener in paper costumes, and singing as they went.</p>
      <p>Next, families sat down for a quiz: they rolled a dice and asked the children questions from the cards. To finish, they looked through the children's books and projects, and Ms. Solo talked with any parents who wanted a word about their child.</p>
